          "latex": "U \\propto \\frac{Z^+ \\times Z^-}{r^+ + r^-}",
          "tags": ["lattice energy"],
          "id": "jee_c12_ch5_add_5"
        },
        {
          "name": "Hybridization Formula",
          "latex": "H = \\frac{1}{2}(V + M - C + A)",
          "tags": ["hybridization"],
          "id": "jee_c12_ch5_add_6"
        },
        {
          "name": "Bond Order",
          "latex": "BO = \\frac{N_b - N_a}{2}",
          "tags": ["bond order"],
          "id": "jee_c12_ch5_add_7"
        },
        {
          "name": "Dipole Moment",
          "latex": "\\mu = q \\times d",
          "tags": ["dipole moment"],
          "id": "jee_c12_ch5_add_8"
        }
      ],
      "keyPoints": [
        "Spectrochemical series: I- < Br- < SCN- < Cl- < S2- < F- < OH- < C2O42- < H2O < NCS- < edta4- < NH3 < en < CN- < CO.",
        "Chromate & Dichromate Preparations: 2CrO42- (yellow) + 2H+ \u21cc Cr2O72- (orange) + H2O",
        "Cr2O72- + 14H+ + 6e- \u2192 2Cr3+ + 7H2O (E\u00b0 = +1.33 V). Oxidizes Fe2+\u2192Fe3+, I-\u2192I2, H2S\u2192S, Sn2+\u2192Sn4+.",
        "Permanganate Preparations: 2MnO4- + 5C2O42- + 16H+ \u2192 2Mn2+ + 10CO2 + 8H2O (Acidic)",
